{"quest":{"line_id":"12010537","line_type":"5","order":284,"title":{"cn":"出航的门道","en":"Way of Voyage","jp":"出航のツテ","kr":"출항 방법"},"description":{"cn":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""},"reputation_camp_id":"202","reputation_camp_title":{"cn":"血薇帮","en":"Carmine Whispers","jp":"ブラッディ・マリー","kr":"블러디 로즈"},"route":"#/season-2/daily/12010537","assets":[{"asset_key":"optional/objective_12010537:1:1"},{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12246470"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_12010537:1:2"},{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12246480"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_12010537:1:3"},{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12246490"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_12010537:1:4"},{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12246500"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_12010537:1:5"},{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12246501"},{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12246510"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_12010537:1:6"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_12010537:1:7"},{"asset_key":"faction_dailies/menu_12010537:1:7"},{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12246520"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_12010537:1:8"},{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12246530"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_12010537:1:9"},{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12246540"}],"tasks":[{"task_id":"1","steps":[{"step_id":"1","pre_step_ids":[],"objective_title":{"cn":"与卢卡交谈","en":"Talk to Lucca","jp":"ルカと話す","kr":"루카와 대화하기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"血薇帮最近很忙，问问卢卡需要什么帮助。","en":"The Carmine Whispers have been as busy as bees lately. Ask Lucca if he needs help.","jp":"最近、ブラッディ・マリーは忙しいようだ。何か手伝えることがあるか、ルカに尋ねよう。","kr":"최근 블러디 로즈가 매우 바쁘다. 루카에게 도움이 필요한지 물어보자."}},{"step_id":"2","pre_step_ids":["1"],"objective_title":{"cn":"前往沙滩","en":"Head to the Beach","jp":"砂浜へ向かう","kr":"해변으로 가기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"卢卡说血薇帮最近在为血薇帮出航做准备，需要你帮忙，先从捡点蓝月刺螺开始。","en":"Lucca says the Carmine Whispers are preparing for their voyage and need your help. You can start by gathering some moon snails.","jp":"ルカによると、最近ブラッディ・マリーは出航の準備を進めているそうで、あなたにアオツキガイ拾いを頼んできた。","kr":"루카는 최근 블러디 로즈가 항해를 준비하고 있다며 도움을 청했다. 먼저 블루문 소라를 모아오자."}},{"step_id":"3","pre_step_ids":["2"],"objective_title":{"cn":"采集蓝月刺螺","en":"Gather Moon Snails","jp":"アオツキガイを集める","kr":"블루문 소라 채집하기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"去沙滩捡一些蓝月刺螺吧，海滩的虾贝是远航人的食材。","en":"Head to the beach to gather some moon snails. Seafarers on long journeys rely on shrimps and shellfish for food.","jp":"砂浜に行ってアオツキガイを拾おう。海辺で獲れるエビや貝は遠方へ航海する人々の食糧になる。","kr":"해변에서 블루문 소라를 줍자. 해변의 새우 껍질은 항해자들의 좋은 식량이다."}},{"step_id":"4","pre_step_ids":["3"],"objective_title":{"cn":"去找商人奥尼克斯","en":"Visit Ornick","jp":"オニクスのところへ行く","kr":"상인 오닉스 찾아가기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"接下来需要炼制治疗药剂，商人奥尼克斯那有材料和坩埚。","en":"It's time to prepare some healing potions. You can get the ingredients and use the crucible at Ornick's place.","jp":"次は回復ポーションを調合しよう。商人オニクスが材料と大釜を持っているはずだ。","kr":"이제 치료 포션을 만들어야 한다. 상인 오닉스에게 재료와 솥이 있다."}},{"step_id":"5","pre_step_ids":["4"],"objective_title":{"cn":"炼制治疗药剂","en":"Prepare Potions","jp":"回復ポーションを調合する","kr":"치료 포션 만들기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"卢卡给商人奥尼克斯打好了招呼，治疗药剂需要的材料早就准备好，可以开始炼制了。","en":"Thanks to Lucca, who has notified Ornick of your arrival, everything needed for the healing potions is ready. You can start preparing them now.","jp":"ルカがオニクスに話を通していたおかげで、回復ポーションの調合に必要な材料はすでに揃っていた。調合を始めよう。","kr":"루카가 상인 오닉스에게 미리 언질을 해두었다. 치료 포션에 필요한 재료가 준비되었으니 만들어 보자."}},{"step_id":"6","pre_step_ids":["5"],"objective_title":{"cn":"前往百炼工坊","en":"Century Forge","jp":"百錬工房へ向かう","kr":"백련 공방으로 가기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"接下来去找呼金拿去卢卡订制的装备。","en":"Now, pick up the custom-made equipment that Lucca ordered from Hugin.","jp":"次はフーキンのところへ行って、ルカが注文していた装備を受け取ろう。","kr":"다음은 후긴에게서 루카가 주문한 장비를 받아와야 한다."}},{"step_id":"7","pre_step_ids":["6"],"objective_title":{"cn":"询问呼金","en":"Ask Hugin","jp":"フーキンに尋ねる","kr":"후긴에게 물어보기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"问问呼金给血薇帮准备的装备好了没有。","en":"Ask Hugin if the equipment is ready.","jp":"ブラッディ・マリー用の装備が用意できているか、フーキンに尋ねよう。","kr":"후긴에게 블러디 로즈를 위한 장비가 준비되었는지 물어보자."}},{"step_id":"8","pre_step_ids":["7"],"objective_title":{"cn":"找到装备","en":"Find Equipment","jp":"装備を探す","kr":"장비 찾기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"在呼金的背包里找到需要的装备。","en":"Find the equipment in Hugin's backpack.","jp":"フーキンのバッグから、必要な装備を探そう。","kr":"후긴의 가방에서 필요한 장비를 찾자."}},{"step_id":"9","pre_step_ids":["8"],"objective_title":{"cn":"回去找卢卡","en":"Return to Lucca","jp":"ルカのところに戻る","kr":"루카에게 돌아가기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"去告诉卢卡你把它托付的事办妥了。","en":"Tell Lucca you've done the task he entrusted to you.","jp":"ルカに任務完了を伝えよう。","kr":"루카에게 돌아가 부탁한 일을 마쳤다고 알려주자."}}]}],"archive_scope":"Configured faction daily paths. Live assignment, NPC visibility and minigame/battle success are not simulated.","source_plot_joins":[{"plot":"12246470","asset":"ep2/quest_story_12246470","resource":"nodecanvas/dialoguetree/ep2/quest_story_12246470.asset","raw_sha256":"c1b7c0e99fcd5c6e4cd387763fd660cf3421bf45ef50d34fee3b80c8c7691049","lpak":"binary_NodeCanvas_DialogueTree_17859706585472604641.lpak","offset":10063432,"size":1424,"identity":"12010537:1:1","field":"verified_npc_task_menu"},{"plot":"12246480","asset":"ep2/quest_story_12246480","resource":"nodecanvas/dialoguetree/ep2/quest_story_12246480.asset","raw_sha256":"3dfe7055d56c9c06e53081bc6405dfb33f76cddbbc50614a7cdfec6a810adc5c","lpak":"binary_NodeCanvas_DialogueTree_17859706585472604641.lpak","offset":10064856,"size":960,"identity":"12010537:1:2","field":"ClientFinishActionByMove"},{"plot":"12246490","asset":"ep2/quest_story_12246490","resource":"nodecanvas/dialoguetree/ep2/quest_story_12246490.asset","raw_sha256":"20e9dec8dff79a908fe91291b930ca16dc706abd18a7933f982338b8f6d61782","lpak":"binary_NodeCanvas_DialogueTree_17859706585472604641.lpak","offset":10065816,"size":944,"identity":"12010537:1:3","field":"FinishAction"},{"plot":"12246500","asset":"ep2/quest_story_12246500","resource":"nodecanvas/dialoguetree/ep2/quest_story_12246500.asset","raw_sha256":"1940c9b2bb316b0a0abfc724c74e834bb912e87900d0ae054558b455dc8657aa","lpak":"binary_NodeCanvas_DialogueTree_17859706585472604641.lpa